<title>FRANCE: Saint-Louis 1996 sales rise slightly.</title>
<headline>Saint-Louis 1996 sales rise slightly.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					35,790    vs   35,267</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>    -- agri-food				   7,441    vs    7,161</p>
<p>    -- paper					28,349    vs   28,106</p>
<p>NOTE - Saint-Louis gave the figures in the BALO official bulletin.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
